{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓星姜棟元繼去年夥拍「韓劇天后」全智賢合演串流劇《暴風圈》後，將與視后金高恩合作明年播映的另一部串流劇《婚：三刻之時》。</p><p>金高恩曾客串演出《暴》劇，今次則是她與姜棟元首度組CP。</p><p>該劇製作班底強勁，由催淚劇《苦盡柑來遇見你》的金元錫導演攜手神劇</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:23:54.501488+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T15:05:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T15:17:16.266909+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T15:17:16.266909+00:00","content_hash":"1970989ee97cb3d59d750b9429bb8174b904def8d258c73b2b06919a392f8ca4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}